# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GP Connect Demo — frontend build settings
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Never commit real values.
# Backend settings live in server/.env (see server/.env.example).
#
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the browser bundle by Vite and is
# therefore PUBLIC.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Set to "off" for a static build without the backend (no sign-in or shared
# features), e.g. a GitHub Pages demo.
# VITE_AUTH=off
# Optional: base path when hosting under a sub-path (e.g. GitHub Pages).
# VITE_BASE_URL=/GP-Connect-Demo/
